1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:01,913
Metal isn't colder than wood.

2
00:00:02,413 --> 00:00:06,057
Leave both in one room, and they reach the same temperature.

3
00:00:06,557 --> 00:00:10,392
But your hand is warmer, about 34 °C.

4
00:00:10,692 --> 00:00:14,549
Aluminium conducts heat over a thousand times better than wood.

5
00:00:15,049 --> 00:00:18,159
So your skin cools more, and faster, on the metal.

6
00:00:18,459 --> 00:00:21,066
That fast cooling is what you feel as cold.

7
00:00:21,566 --> 00:00:22,667
Same temperature.

8
00:00:22,667 --> 00:00:23,703
Different speed.
